frames 3
move 699 786
frames 1
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 880 346
frames 1
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 300 434
frames 1
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 880 346
frames 1
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
